      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEROCCA BERNIE (2) resumes after campaigning in Queensland over the winter where he was a dominant Albion Park winner three back. Has not raced for ten weeks but looks forward enough for the return after a minor placing in a recent trial and is likely to get the favours from this nice draw. HOPPALONGPOG (1) has been competitive since he led to win here three back, coming from this barrier to place last time. Can continue the good form. BETTING RANGER (9) draws for a trail and added to a series of top-four results by finishing runner-up at this circuit and distance last time out. Can make an impact again. OHOKA COBRA NZ (7) draws wider but is building into his campaign and could be close to a win after a second at his most recent appearance at Penrith.",
